1. Code: MIT License
--------------------

Covers the source code and configuration: the TypeScript, JavaScript, Astro components, CSS and build, test and
deployment scripts under site/ (src/components, src/layouts, src/lib, src/pages, src/scripts, src/styles, src/views,
integrations, scripts, tests), worker/ (src, scripts, test), chat-widget/, design/scripts/ and the design token files
(design/tokens.*), and the configuration files at the repository root and in each package. It does not cover the
content listed in section 2, even where that content sits in the same folders.

